      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Iron working was attempted twice in Newburg, with the Ozark Iron Works starting after 1867 and the Knotwell Iron Company briefly operating in 1880.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
